{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120664","id":3943109400,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7rBxMY","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120664","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120664.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120664.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120664","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120664/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120664/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120664/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/feb10595bd6bc0be95dfef6ae47e2f845fb66612","number":120664,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Improve shader and editor error reporting","user":{"login":"moluopro","id":55039286,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MDM5Mjg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55039286?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluopro","html_url":"https://github.com/moluopro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluopro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluopro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluopro/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluopro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluopro/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluopro/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluopro/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluopro/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moluopro/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problems does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nSome `RD shader` compilation failures did not print detailed diagnostics through Godot's standard error reporting path. As a result, those details were not shown in the editor `Output` panel or terminal.\r\n\r\nWhen multiple errors were reported during editor load or import, the editor could also try to pop up the same error dialog repeatedly.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n- Print `.glsl` import errors and `RenderingDevice` shader compilation errors through Godot's standard error reporting path.\r\n- Include shader stage names in diagnostics, and avoid repeating the full compile log when shader creation uses bytecode whose compile error was already printed.\r\n- Complete the existing shader stage name table for ray tracing stages.\r\n- Keep detailed compile errors available for `RDShaderSPIRV` resources with compile errors.\r\n- Avoid repeated popup attempts while the editor Load Errors dialog is already visible, and safely defer shader import Load Errors messages to the main thread.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1609442062,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjA5NDQyMDYy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:shaders","name":"topic:shaders","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","descriptio